check 1
# Two casts in a row (q-fix-pt-cast-input-lock): ScnSor (expansion
# Sorceress, level 30, every skill at 20, right skill 44 Frost Nova),
# -seed 1234; warp to the Blood Moor (level 2; variant blood-moor-empty)
# before frame 4, then a right click at client pixel (330, 300) before
# frame 20's drain and the same click before frame 60's. Frost Nova
# needs no target. Compares the player (mode per frame: the second cast
# must start on the same frame on both sides, i.e. the client ended its
# first cast mode and sent the second C→S 0x0C). Spec:
# specs/tools/scenario-diff.md.
name sor-frost-nova-twice
save ScnSor --class sor --expansion --level 30 --all-skills 20 --right-skill 44
seed 1234
ticks 100
seconds 300
channels state
variant blood-moor-empty
at 4 poke warp 2
input frame 20; rclick 330 300; frame 60; rclick 330 300
